# The demo's index.html is LF-only by design and check_social_card.py asserts CR==0.
# Without this, a global core.autocrlf=true rewrites it to CRLF on checkout and the
# gate fails on a clean clone even though the committed blob is correct.
*.html text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.woff2 binary
